OL,3,GNEWSARescue centre says cats will die
OL,4,Adue to lack of space
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cat rescuer has said she fears cats
OL,7,Fand kittens could be left to die on the
OL,8,Fstreet due to centres running out of
OL,9,Fspace.
OL,11,FZoey Sheffield, who runs Cat Patrol in
OL,12,FMapperley, Nottingham, said her work
OL,13,Fwas "relentless" and she received
OL,14,Fmessages around the clock for help,
OL,15,Fwith 200 cats also on their waiting
OL,16,Flist.
OL,18,FShe said this year had been the
OL,19,Fcentre's busiest, with 500 cats coming
OL,20,Fto the shelter in the last six months -
OL,21,Fdouble the amount of last year.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
