OL,3,GNEWSARescue centre says cats will die
OL,4,Adue to lack of space
OL,5,
OL,6,FSheffield said she believed the rise
OL,7,Fwas down to the cost of living and
OL,8,Fadded her rescue centre could now not
OL,9,Ftake on any more cats unless it was an
OL,10,F"absolute emergency situation".
